@startuml Python API Classes
!theme plain
title Python API Classes - RH Nexus

class CandidateEvaluator {
    - model: RandomForestClassifier
    - features: list
    + __init__(model_path: str)
    + load_model(path: str): RandomForestClassifier
    + load_candidates(csv_path: str): DataFrame
    + evaluate_candidates(df: DataFrame, threshold: float): DataFrame
    + detect_id(df: DataFrame): str
    + print_results(df: DataFrame, group_size: int): void
}

class ModelTrainer {
    - features: list
    - model: RandomForestClassifier
    + __init__()
    + load_data(csv_path: str): DataFrame
    + preprocess_data(df: DataFrame): DataFrame
    + train_model(X: array, y: array): RandomForestClassifier
    + save_model(model: RandomForestClassifier, path: str): void
    + evaluate_model(model: RandomForestClassifier, X_test: array, y_test: array): dict
}

class DataProcessor {
    + normalize_features(df: DataFrame): DataFrame
    + encode_categorical(df: DataFrame): DataFrame
    + handle_missing_values(df: DataFrame): DataFrame
    + scale_features(df: DataFrame): DataFrame
}

note right of CandidateEvaluator
  Clase principal para
  evaluación de candidatos
  usando machine learning
end note

note right of ModelTrainer
  Clase para entrenamiento
  del modelo de Random Forest
end note

note right of DataProcessor
  Clase para procesamiento
  y normalización de datos
end note

@enduml
